      s20 --> s21: a grown-up opens বড#2492;দ#2503;র জন#2509;য [when Race is not Rest screen after the race and Window is You're on the page]
      s21 --> s20: বন#2509;ধ কর#2507;, one use, a minute or hiding the tab closes it
    }
